[[Taskmaster Nard]] is one of the [[boss]]es who leads a wave of [[Stone Summit]] [[Dwarf|Dwarves]] in the [[quest]] [[Attack on Jalis's Camp]]. 

== Locations ==
* [[Far Shiverpeaks]]
** {{NPC location|Attack on Jalis's Camp}}

== Skills ==
16 [[Death Magic]]
* {{skill icon|Animate Bone Minions}}
* {{skill icon|Animate Shambling Horror}}
* {{skill icon|Death Nova}}
* {{skill icon|Deathly Swarm}}
* {{skill icon|Jagged Bones}} ([[elite]])
* {{skill icon|Signet of Lost Souls}}
* {{skill icon|Taste of Death}}

== Notes ==
* You may want to kill Taskmaster Nard before the other Stone Summit in the wave as he can build up a large army of [[minion]]s from their corpses.
* [[Verata's Aura]] can also be very useful against him.  As there are also [[Stone Summit Gnasher]]s, you can gain control of a large number of minions.
